erview of Wind Energy and Aircraft Engine Noise Research</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; at GE Global Research (첨부물 참조)</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>주관 : 지능기계공학과</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>재학생들의 많은 참석 부탁드리겠습니다.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>감사합니다.</strong></span></p><p><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>(문의사항 : 054-478-7390_지능기계공학과)</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
